OL,3,GNEWSAMan in life-threatening condition
OL,4,Aafter shop raid
OL,5,
OL,6,FA jewellery store employee is in a
OL,7,Flife-threatening condition after a
OL,8,Frobbery in broad daylight at a shop in
OL,9,FPeterborough.
OL,11,FCambridgeshire Police said six men
OL,12,Fraided Lala Jewellers on Gladstone
OL,13,FStreet at about 11:50 GMT on Saturday.
OL,15,FA senior councillor later said it was
OL,16,Fbelieved that the victim had been
OL,17,Fstabbed.
OL,19,FThe city's MP described it as a
OL,20,F"horrific and violent act", while
OL,21,Fpolice have appealed for witnesses to
OL,22,Fcome forward.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
